---
const mailtoBody = encodeURIComponent(`Product URL:

Flow that breaks:

What users do instead:

What this costs you:

Who needs the review:

Evidence available:
`);
---
<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-tagline">Send me the flow that is already failing.</div>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Send this brief.</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:0.75rem; font-size:0.95rem; max-width:620px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Send the flow your team keeps explaining, compensating for, or routing around. I will tell you whether it fits a Hidden Scaffold Review.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:1rem; font-size:0.95rem; max-width:620px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Not sure if this is a guidance failure? Send the flow anyway.</p>
    <div class="brief-list" aria-label="Hidden Scaffold Review brief checklist">
      <div><span>Product URL</span></div>
      <div><span>Flow that breaks</span></div>
      <div><span>What users do instead</span></div>
      <div><span>What this costs you</span></div>
      <div><span>Who needs the review</span></div>
      <div><span>Evidence available</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-note-stack">
      <p class="safety-note">Do not send private customer data, credentials, or regulated data in the first email. Describe the pattern first.</p>
      <p class="cooperation-note">A Hidden Scaffold Review works only when there is evidence to inspect and an owner willing to act on the finding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-links">
      <a href={`mailto:yassergandhi.dev@gmail.com?subject=Hidden%20Scaffold%20Review&body=${mailtoBody}`} class="contact-link btn-primary contact-cta">Request a Hidden Scaffold Review</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yassergandhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link"><span class="contact-link-label">LinkedIn</span><span class="contact-link-value">/in/yassergandhi</span></a>
      <a href="https://github.com/yassergandhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link"><span class="contact-link-label">GitHub</span><span class="contact-link-value">/yassergandhi</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-footer">Ciudad de México · Remote · Guidance Failure Architecture · TypeScript · Supabase · Zod · 2026 <span class="cursor"></span></div>
  </div>
</section>
